{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Officers of the hosts.</b> They station rank-closers before them and behind them, with iron chains in their hands, and whoever wants to turn back — he has permission to strike his legs. 'Rank-closers' — men standing at the edge of the battle line to straighten the fallen and strengthen them with words: Return to the battle and do not flee, for the beginning of falling is fleeing (Sifrei; Sotah 44)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:47.027958898Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}